### E-Learn API Tests

### 1. Get All Courses (No Auth Required)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/courses

### 2. Register a New User
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@test.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "name": "John Doe",
  "goal": "Learn React"
}

### 3. Login User
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### 4. Get Current User (Requires Token)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### 5. Get Single Course
GET http://localhost:3000/api/courses/1

### 6. Get User Dashboard (Requires Token)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### 7. Enroll in Course (Requires Token)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/courses/1/enroll
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
Content-Type: application/json

{}